  "description": "A high-performance, lightweight Redis wrapper based on StackExchange.Redis for .NET Standard 2.0.\n\t\t\tIt features a hybrid architecture supporting both Dependency Injection (DI) and simplified Static calls (e.g., Cache.Set, MQ.Publish).\n\n\t\t\tFeatures:\n\t\t\t- Core: Built on the stable StackExchange.Redis.\n\t\t\t- GRedis.Cache: Simplified Key-Value caching with JSON serialization.\n\t\t\t- GRedis.MQ: Lightweight Message Queue (List) and Pub/Sub implementation.\n\t\t\t- Dual-Mode: Seamlessly switch between IOC/DI patterns and static facade access.",
